  "notes": [
    "Vectors were produced by running flock's own app/src/pin.ts (copied verbatim, unmodified) against kindependence's installed canary-kit — not by running kindependence's app/src/pins.ts.",
    "Kindependence's pins.ts is a hand mirror of flock's pin.ts as of d569b17 (tombstone/anti-resurrection form) + a6a52d7 (18-kind vocabulary).",
    "Flock's pin.ts has since gained 6bea625 (pin durability anti-entropy), which added ONE new export to pin.ts itself: authoredPins(list, pk) — a pure selection helper (pins whose latest held state a given pubkey authored, tombstones included). Everything else in pin.ts (vocabulary, buildPinSignal, decryptPin, withPin) is unchanged since d569b17/a6a52d7.",
    "Flock's own withPin has no live-pin cap. Kindependence's applyPin/PIN_CAP is a kindependence-only local addition on top of withPin's merge and is intentionally NOT exercised here (see flock-pin-vectors.test.ts)."
  ],
